    "durationMs": 241482,
    "finalText": "Done. The URL Shortener API is complete and verified. Since the workspace had no starter project, I built it from scratch:\n\n**Implementation**\n- `app/main.py` — FastAPI app with `POST /links` (201, generated or custom codes, 409 on duplicates), `GET /links` (ascending creation order with `items`/`total`), `GET /links/{code}` (404 unknown), and `GET /r/{code}` (302 redirect with an atomic `clicks + 1` update). Exception handlers return `{\"error\": ...}` for 404/409/422, including malformed JSON.\n- `app/schemas.py` — Pydantic validation: URL must be absolute http/https with a host (checked via `urlparse`, stored/returned unchanged — no normalization), codes must match `^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{4,20}$`; generated codes are 8 random chars with uniqueness retries.\n- `app/database.py` + `app/config.py` — SQLAlchemy 2.0-style engine reading `DATABASE_URL` from the environment (rewritten to the installed psycopg 3 driver), sync sessions per request.\n- `app/models.py` — `links` table: `id` (creation order), unique `code`, `url`, `clicks`, `created_at`.\n- Alembic migration `0001_create_links` wired to the same env var; `start.sh` runs `alembic upgrade head` then `exec python -m uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000` in the foreground.\n- `requirements.txt` pins the stack versions plus `fastapi==0.162.6`; README documents startup and endpoints.\n\n**Verification** — a 34-assertion httpx suite passed against a fresh database: all status codes (201/404/409/422/302), error bodies, exact URL preservation, click increments (exactly once per redirect), list ordering, and edge cases (min/max code lengths, malformed/empty/array JSON bodies, `http://` with no host). I restarted the server twice mid-test and confirmed links and click counts survive restarts, `alembic upgrade head` is idempotent, and `start.sh` works from any cwd. The test server is stopped, port 8000 is free, and the database is reset to an empty state for the grading run."
